----- SOURCE CODE
(peg/match ~(some (constant :x)) "a")

----- HOVER some
```janet
(some patt)
```
PEG special

Matches `patt` one or more times.

----- HOVER constant
```janet
(constant value ?tag)
```
PEG special

Captures `value`, consuming no input.
